{
    "mapping": "crm-load Salesforce snapshot -> EspoCRM 10.0.12 mapping",
    "mappingVersion": 2,
    "contractVersion": 4,
    "notes": [
        "Values follow docs/MIGRATION-DECISIONS.md D1-D13 (from the CRM-002 delivery) and the PL value tables of CRM-006R (counts-only L3 analysis).",
        "copy: the Salesforce value as is; enum: copied only if it is one of the target options, else left empty with exception enum_unmapped.",
        "Every attribute listed here must exist in the target entityDefs or the 10.0.12 core (TestStatic in tests/load/test_load.py).",
        "Opportunity Post_code__c and Key_Information__c are not in the contract: postcode and keyInformation stay empty.",
        "Contact Phone (Office, primary) and MobilePhone (Mobile) go to phoneNumberData.",
        "Meeting attendees: the owner only (EventRelation is not in the contract). Meeting status: Held if EndDateTime is before the manifest t_start, else Planned.",
        "OpportunityContactRole.Role: null -> \"\"; a value outside Contact.opportunityRole options -> \"\" with exception role_unmapped."
    ],
